5 Discussion
Our study on English to Faroese machine translation reveals several important findings that provide new insights into the relative strengths of different approaches to low-resource language translation, including large language models and specialized multilingual models. Surprisingly, the finetuned NLLB model outperformed most LLMs, including GPT-4 and GPT-SW3 40B, in both au
